Following the snippet from the url you sent me here is what I did and
the output I got:
chipType <- "mDIV";
cdf <- AffymetrixCdfFile$byChipType(chipType)
ugp <- AromaUgpFile$allocateFromCdf(cdf, tags="");
filename <- "genomeinfo.txt";
path <- "annotationData/chipTypes/mDIV/"
dat <- TabularTextFile(filename, path=path);
print(dat);

